invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: a WIDEMUL=runtime object stops carrying the native copy of
  mlkem_poly.c, and its link fails on the _native names widemul.h calls
  only where something links it. lint-trust-separation's ROLE=server row
  requires every file of WIDEMUL_COPIED beside its native copy.

--- old
WIDEMUL_COPIED := poly1305.c x25519.c mlkem_poly.c p256_field.c p256_scalar.c rsa_sign.c
--- new
WIDEMUL_COPIED := poly1305.c x25519.c p256_field.c p256_scalar.c rsa_sign.c
